{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.madoka.sign",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "桌上放着一张签名的草稿",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.madoka.sign",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.madoka.sign",
    "idolId": "madoka",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（円香……她还有继续当偶像的意思吧。）",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（不是什么理由很清楚的女孩，但她确实……）",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──好。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（发消息问她在哪。）",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "原来在这里啊，我找了好久……！",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……有什么事吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，你把签名的方案放在桌上了吧？设计非常好，OK！",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "这样啊。就是为了这个特意过来。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我想直接跟你道谢。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "老实说，我以为会交上来更随便的东西……所以很高兴。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "不是为了让你高兴。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，那倒是。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不过签名是继续当偶像很重要的东西……你想了很多吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "没有，只是随便写的。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "难道是一笔写成？",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "一笔写成。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦！那很厉害，我吓到了……円香有才能啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "廉价的话。那种的，我讨厌。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "因为能看穿你在想打开我的心。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊……不，嗯……！我真的只是那么想而已……",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……还是说，在円香眼里我像是会打心理战的智性派？",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "──不好对付的男人。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈……",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "总是那样笑着，装得从容。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我没有那个意思……",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……不，不过从容是想要的。因为我想和円香对等地说话。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……对等？",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "现在不行，但总有一天我也要，和幼驯染的大家一样──",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "哈？",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这种话绝对不会说出口……！你们的距离感，我实在靠近不了。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……你多少开始明白了嘛。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "因为我是智性派！哈哈哈……",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "刚、刚才那句是吐槽点……！……嘛，算了……",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "円香，是喜欢大家的吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……喜欢还是讨厌，我不会特意去想。",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "因为在一起是理所当然的。",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯……",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，这样啊──",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "只要继续当偶像，就能一直在一起嘛。",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……谁知道呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "44"
      },
      "44": {
        "id": "44",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "円香……",
        "nextNodeId": "45"
      },
      "45": {
        "id": "45",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……已经够了吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "46"
      },
      "46": {
        "id": "46",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "那么。",
        "nextNodeId": "47"
      },
      "47": {
        "id": "47",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "………………",
        "nextNodeId": "48"
      },
      "48": {
        "id": "48",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……哈啊。"
      }
    }
  },
